 "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16m2p.jpg"}, {"id": 1988167, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16m2v.jpg"}, {"id": 1988162, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16m2q.jpg"}, {"id": 1988163, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16m2r.jpg"}, {"id": 1988165, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16m2t.jpg"}, {"id": 1988166, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16m2u.jpg"}, {"id": 1988168, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16m2w.jpg"}], "slug": "for-the-warp-void-echoes", "summary": "Escape the void in a roguelike deckbuilder in space!\n\nDeep inside an ancient space temple, you discover a valuable artifact. But as soon as you escape, all organic life in the system begins to be purged. With the drone plague spreading, your only hope is to reach the Pan-Human Sector.\n\nExplore procedurally generated systems, build your deck, and fight your way to the next warp gate. Discover and add powerful cards and equipment to your arsenal, encounter allies and foes, explore the ruins of ancient civilizations, and unlock powerful technologies and ships.\n\nThis definitive console edition merges the core game with the massive Void Echoes content overhaul, delivering rebalanced gameplay, deeper strategy, and intense, time sensitive survival.\n\nBuild your strategy, adapt to new threats, and do whatever it takes to survive the journey.", "themes": [{"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/for-the-warp-void-echoes", "videos": [{"id": 203057, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "HxspMCgOdW8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HxspMCgOdW8", "title": "For The Warp: Void Echoes Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/HxspMCgOdW8/fhddefault.jpg"}]}